"description": "<p>The Daily Wolf host Scott Melker, the Wolf of All Streets, looks past the whiplash in global markets to the quieter changes in how Bitcoin and crypto are being used. Including new CFTC staff guidance letting exchanges count Bitcoin, ether and stablecoins toward their financial resource requirements, Cross River Bank launching Bitcoin-backed consumer loans of up to $250,000, and BTCS selling more than half its ether to repay an Aave loan in a warning sign for crypto treasury companies.</p>",
