"title": "What Does HSBC Holdings (LSE:HSBA) Crypto Theft Code Exposure Mean For Investors?",
"description": null,
"summary": "HSBC Holdings (LSE:HSBA) was listed among 178 major websites hit by crypto-stealing code, according to a recent security report. The malicious script was reportedly embedded in live web pages, raising questions about how long user interactions may have been exposed. Security researchers linked the incident to a coordinated campaign targeting financial and cryptocurrency related platforms worldwide. The discovery of crypto stealing code on HSBC related sites is important, but it should not...",
